# File: .prettierignore
# Description: Excludes generated and local-only files from formatting checks.
# Purpose: Prevents format tooling from rewriting machine output or dependency artifacts.
# Notes: Human-authored source and configuration remain in the formatting scope.

# Generated package, build, test, and emulator state is never hand-formatted.
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/
dist/
coverage/
.vite/
.wrangler/
supabase/.branches/
supabase/.temp/
pnpm-lock.yaml
